---
title: "borrow_with_referral (Scallop Sui Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: assert_current_version(version)
    q_version --> q_whitelist: assert_whitelist_access(market, ctx)
    q_whitelist --> q_get_discount: borrow_fee_discount = borrow_referral::borrow_fee_discount(referral)
    q_get_discount --> q_get_share: borrow_fee_referral_share = borrow_referral::referral_share(referral)
    q_get_share --> q_borrow_internal: borrow_internal(obligation, ..., discount, share, ...)
    q_borrow_internal --> q_increase_borrowed: borrow_referral::increase_borrowed_v2(referral, borrow_amount)
    q_increase_borrowed --> q_put_fee: borrow_referral::put_referral_fee_v2(referral, referral_fee)
    q_put_fee --> [*]: return coin::from_balance(borrowed_balance, ctx)

    note right of q_get_discount
        INV-001: referral discount reduces borrow fee for borrower
        INV-002: referral share is split from base fee before protocol receives it
    end note

    note right of q_borrow_internal
        INV-003: borrow_internal applies same health and limit checks as regular borrow
        INV-004: referral_fee = base_fee * referral_share / fee_rate_base
        INV-005: deducted_fee = base_fee * discount / fee_rate_base
        INV-006: final_fee = base_fee - referral_fee - deducted_fee
    end note
